 and \par                                               the Pricing Supplement have not \par                                               been reviewed, registered or authorized \par                                               by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (\f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 ) \par                                               for their distribution through banking \par                                               institutions in Indonesia. \par             (d) General:                     No action has been or will be taken \par                                               by the Issuer that would permit \par                                               a public offering of the Notes, \par                                               or possession or distribution of \par                                               any offering material relating to \par                                               the Notes in any jurisdiction where \par                                               action for that purpose is required. \par                                               Accordingly, the Dealer agrees that \par                                               it will observe all applicable provisions \par                                               of law in each jurisdiction in or \par                                               from which it may offer or sell \par                                               Notes or distribute any offering \par                                               material. \par  Other Relevant Terms \par  1.         Listing:                         Application has been made for the \par                                               Notes to be admitted to the Official \par                                               List of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 United Kingdom Listing \par                                               Authority\f28 \uc2 \f2  and to trading on