ssue Price will be payable \par                                                        in United States Dollars ("U.S.$" \par                                                          or "USD") in the amount of USD \par                                                         38,490,737.60 at the agreed IDR \par                                                         Rate of IDR 11,795 per one USD. \par        4.      Issue Date:                      August 15, 2014 \par        5.      Form of Notes \par                 (Condition 1(a)):                Registered only, as further provided \par                                                  in paragraph 10(c) of "Other Relevant \par                                                  Terms" below. \par        6.      Authorized Denomination(s) \par                  (Condition 1(b)):               IDR 10,000,000 and integral multiples \par                                                  thereof \par        7.      Specified \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                 (Condition 1(d)):                The lawful \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the Republic \par                                                  of Indonesia ("Indonesian Rupiah" \par                                                  or "IDR"), provided that all payments \par                                                  in respect of the Notes will be \par                                                  made in United States Dollars ("U.S.$" \par                                                  or "USD") \par        8.      Specified Principal Payment \par                 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                 (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)):      USD \par        9.      Specified Interest Payment \par                 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                          USD \par                 (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)): \par        10.     Maturity Date \par                 (Condition 6(a); Fixed            July 17, 2017 \par                 Interest Rate): \par        11.     Interest Basis \par                 (Condition 5):                   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition \par                                                  5(I)) \par        12.     Interest Commencement Date \par                 (Condition 5(III)):               June 26, 2014 \par        13.     Fixed Interest Rate (Condition   Condition 5(I) as amended and supplemented \par                 5(I)):                           below, shall apply to the Notes. \par                                                  The bases of the Calculation of \par                                                  the Interest Amount, Interest Payment \par                                                  Dates and default interest are \par                                                  as set out below. \par  \par                  (a) Interest Rate:              7.25 percent per annum \par                (b) Business Day Convention:     Following Business Day Convention \par                (c) Fixed Rate Interest \par                 Payment Date(s):                  Annually on each July 17, commencing \par                                                   on July 17, 2015 and ending on, \par                                                   and including, the Maturity Date. \par                                                   Each Interest Payment Date is subject \par                                                   to adjustment in accordance with \par                                                   the Following Business Day Convention \par                                                   with no adjustment to the amount \par                                                   of interest otherwise calculated. \par                (d) Interest Period:             Each period from and including \par                                                  each Interest Payment Date to but \par                                                  excluding the next following Interest \par                                                  Payment Date, provided that the \par                                                  initial Interest Period will commence \par                                                  on and include the Interest Commencement \par                                                  Date, and the final Interest Period \par                                                  will end on but exclude the Maturity \par                                                  Date. \par                (e) Initial Broken Amount:       A USD amount equal to: \par                                                  IDR 766,712.33 per minimum Authorized \par                                                  Denomination, divided by the Applicable \par                                                  Rate (as defined below), calculated \par                                                  on the relevant Fixing Date (as \par                                                  defined below) in accordance with \par                                                  13(g) below and payable on July \par                                                  17, 2015 \par                (f) Fixed Rate Day Count \par                 Fraction(s):                     Actual/Actual ICMA \par                (g) Calculation of Interest      As soon as practicable and in accordance \par                 Amount:                          with the procedure specified herein, \par                                                  the Calculation Agent will determine \par                                                  the Applicable Rate (as defined \par                                                  below) and calculate the amount \par                                                  of interest payable (the "Interest \par                                                  Amount") with respect to each Authorized \par                                                  Denomination for the relevant Interest \par                                                  Period. \par                                                  The Interest Amount with respect \par                                                  to any Interest Period shall be \par                                                  a USD amount calculated on the \par                                                  relevant Fixing Date (as defined \par                                                  below) as follows: \par                                                  7.25% times minimum Authorized \par                                                  Denomination \par                                                  times \par                                                  the Fixed Rate Day Count Fraction \par                                                  divided by \par                                                  the Applicable Rate \par  \par                                                  (and rounding, if necessary, the \par                                                  entire resulting figure to the \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 15-08-14 1642GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                  nearest two decimal places, with \par                                                  USD 0.005 being rounded upwards). \par  \par                                                  The "Applicable Rate" means the \par                                                  rate determined by the Calculation \par                                                  Agent that is equal to the USD/IDR \par                                                  spot rate at 11:00 a.m. Singapore \par                                                  time, expressed as the amount of \par                                                  IDR per one USD, for settlement \par                                                  in two IDR Business Days, reported \par                                                  on Reuters page JISDOR (or such \par                                                  other page or service as may replace \par                                                  any such page for the purposes \par                                                  of displaying the USD/IDR reference \par                                                  rate) at or around 11:00 a.m. Singapore \par                                                  time on the Fixing Date (such date, \par                                                  subject to adjustment as described \par                                                  below). Fallback Provisions apply \par                                                  as per below. \par                                                 The "Fixing Date" means the date \par                                                  that is five IDR Business Days \par                                                  prior to the applicable Interest \par                                                  Payment Date or Maturity Date. \par                                                  The Fixing Date shall be subject \par                                                  to adjustment as follows: if the \par                                                  scheduled date of the Fixing Date \par                                                  is not a Relevant Business Day, \par                                                  then the Fixing Date will be the \par                                                  first preceding day that is a Relevant \par                                                  Business Day. \par                                                  "IDR Business Day" means a day \par                       