\par\par \b \uc2 EM ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Rupiah hits 2-month peak after Jokowi wins presidential election\b0\par\par\uc2 600 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juli 2014\par 10:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates prices. For earlier report, click on )               \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, July 23 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah rose to its highest level in two months on Wednesday after Joko "Jokowi" Widodo was declared the winner of the presidential election, although its gains were tempered by suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .               \par \par \uc2 The rupiah rose more than 0.9 percent at one point and touched a high of around 11,485 versus the dollar  , its strongest since late May, according to Thomson Reuters data.               \par \par \uc2 As the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rallied, a spokesman for \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stabilise the rupiah.               \par \par \uc2 Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was detected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy the dollar versus the rupiah, helping to limit the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains.               \par \par \uc2 The rupiah last stood at 11,510 to the dollar, still up around 0.7 percent on the day.               \par \par \uc2 The election result could spur an extended relief rally and eventually buoy the rupiah to levels around 11,300 or 11,400, said Mirza Baig, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and interest rate strategy Asia for \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2  in Singapore.               \par \par \uc2 "But I would expect that the \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  appetite for dollars will be there. \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  likely wants to rebuild its \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves," Baig said, adding that the rupiah may return to a range of 11,500 to 11,800 in a few months.               \par \par \uc2 Indonesia's Elections Commission, known as KPU, said on Tuesday that Jokowi had won the July 9 presidential election over his rival, former general Prabowo Subianto.               \par \par \uc2 The head of Prabowo's legal team said on Wednesday that Prabowo plans to challenge the result in the Constitutional Court. The challenge had been widely expected, but many analysts believe it would be near impossible for Prabowo to overturn the result of the election.               \par \par \uc2 "Jokowi's margin of over 8 million votes should serve as a substantial buffer in any court dispute," Wellian Wiranto, an economist for \uc2 OCBC Bank\uc2 , said in a research note.               \par \par \uc2 Other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  also mostly pushed higher, including the Malaysian ringgit and the Philippine peso .               \par \par \uc2 Investor interest in relatively high-yielding assets has been seen as a source of support for emerging Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently, despite lingering worries about geopolitical tensions.                              \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR                      \par  Change on the day at   0749 GMT    \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       101.36         101.46       +0.10\par  Sing dlr        1.2388         1.2396       +0.06\par  Taiwan dlr      30.025         30.035       +0.03\par  Korean won     1023.90        1024.40       +0.05\par  Baht             31.75          31.77       +0.06\par  Peso             43.23          43.41    