le Interest \par                                            Payment Date or Maturity Date. \par                                            The Fixing Date shall be subject \par                                            to adjustment as follows: if the \par                                            scheduled date of the Fixing Date \par                                            is not a Relevant Business Day, \par                                            then the Fixing Date will be the \par                                            first preceding day that is a \par                                            Relevant Business Day. \par                                            "IDR Business Day" means a day \par                                            (other than a Saturday or a Sunday) \par                                            on which banks and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                            markets are open for business \par                                            in Singapore. \par                                            "Fallback Provisions": Should \par                                             no USD/IDR reference rate appear \par                                             on Reuters page JISDOR (or on \par                                             such replacement page as described \par                                             above) on the Fixing Date, then \par                                             the USD/IDR reference rate for \par                                             such Fixing Date shall be determined \par                                             by the Calculation Agent by requesting \par                                             quotations for the mid USD/IDR \par                                             spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate either \par                             