sdiction \par                                                  where action for that purpose \par                                                  is required. Accordingly, each \par                                                  of the Managers agrees that it \par                                                  will observe all applicable provisions \par                                                  of law in each jurisdiction in \par                                                  or from which it may offer or \par                                                  sell Notes or distribute any offering \par                                                  material. \par  Other Relevant Terms \par  1.            Listing:                         Application has been made for \par                                                  the Notes to be admitted to the \par                                                  Official List of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 United Kingdom \par                                                  Listing Authority\f28 \uc2 \f2  and to trading \par                                                  on the \f28 \uc2 \f2 London Stock Exchange plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \par                                                  Regulated Market. \par  2.            Details of Clearance System \par                 Approved by the Bank and \par                 the \par                 Global Agent and Clearance       Euroclear and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Clearstream\f28 \uc2 \f2 , Luxembourg \par                 and \par                 Settlement Procedures: \par  3.            Syndicated:                      Yes \par  4.            If Syndicated: \par                       (a) Liability:            Several and not joint \par                       (b) Managers:             \f28 \uc2 \f2 HSBC Bank plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 The Toronto-Dominion Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par  5.            Commissions and Concessions:     1.3750% of the Aggregate Principal \par                            