ion in respect of the Bank and this offer of the Notes is only available on the basis of the combination of this Pricing Supplement and the Prospectus.\par \par \uc2 Terms and Conditions\par \par \uc2 The following items under this heading "Terms and Conditions" are the particular terms which relate to the issue the subject of this Pricing Supplement. These are the only terms which form part of the form of Notes for such issue.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  1.         (a) Series No.:             434 \par              (b) Tranche No.:            2 \par  2.    Aggregate Principal Amount:      IDR 400,000,000,000 \par                                          As from the Issue Date, the \par                                          Notes will be consolidated and \par                                          form a single series with the \par                                          Series 434 Tranche 1 Notes \par  3.    Issue Price:                         IDR 395,165,506,849.32, which \par                                          is 97.5585 percent of the Aggregate \par                                            Principal Amount plus the amount \par                                          of IDR 4,931,506,849.32 representing \par                                              100 days' accrued interest, \par                                                       inclusive \par  \par                                            The Issue Price will be payable \par                                              in USD in the amount of USD \par                                              34,332,363.76 at the agreed \par                                             IDR Rate of 11,510 IDR per one \par                                                          USD. \par  4.    Issue Date:                      May 15, 2014 \par  5.    Form of Notes \par         (Condition 1(a)):                Registered only, as further \par                                          provided in parag