ondon Stock \par                                             Exchange plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Regulated Market. \par  2.     Details of Clearance System \par          Approved by the Bank and \par          the \par          Global Agent and Clearance         Euroclear and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Clearstream\f28 \uc2 \f2 , \par          and                                Luxembourg \par          Settlement Procedures: \par  3.     Syndicated:                        No \par  4.     Commissions and Concessions:       1.375% of the Aggregate Principal \par                                             Amount (comprised of a 1.1875% \par                                             selling concession and a 0.1875% \par                                             management and underwriting \par                                             fee). \par  5.     Estimated Total Expenses:          None. The Dealer has agreed \par                                             to pay for all material expenses \par                                             related to the issuance of the \par                                             Notes. \par  6.     Codes: \par   (a) Common Code:                         088181174 \par   (b) ISIN:                                XS0881811748 \par  7.     Identity of Dealer:                \f28 \uc2 \f2 The Toronto-Dominion Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par  8.     Identity of Calculation            \f28 \uc2 \f2 The Toronto-Dominion Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2 , Toronto \par          Agent: \par                                             In relation to the Fixing Date, \par                                             as soon as is reasonably practicable \par                                             after the determination of the \par                                             Applicable Rate in relation \par                                             thereto, on the date on which \par                                             the relevant Applicable Rate \par              