\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesian Rupiah Joins Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Selloff\b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Januar 2014\par 05:57\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 0457 GMT [Dow Jones] USD/IDR could rally much higher as the Indonesian rupiah becomes the next target for speculative investors looking to profit from the emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rout. Signs of increased volatility for the rupiah are appearing as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell 0.5% Monday--its biggest drop since early January. The rupiah has the potential to fall much more, possibly to 12,390, if USD/IDR ends the day above 12,220 and thereby inside the daily Bollinger uptrend channel--a bullish technical signal for the dollar. On Friday, the Indian rupee--a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that bears similar traits to the rupiah because of their high-yielding nature--tumbled sharply. The rupee and rupiah were both attractive \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold at a time when there was an abundance of investment inflows related to U.S. quantitative easing. But as the U.S. Federal Reserve reduces its pace of bond buying, these \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been losing their appeal.\par \par \uc2  The main reason the rupiah hasn't weakened much so far is \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is known to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to prevent excessive rupiah weakness in order to avert investor panic. Punters, however, will be placing their bets on the USD/IDR nondeliverable forward contracts, which are beyond the influence of \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2 , and in this way reflect better market sentiment for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . USD/IDR is now 12,240 from its Friday close of 12,175. (ewen.chew@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; MarketTalk@dowjones.com \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 January 26, 2014 23:57 ET (04:57 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020140127ea1r000bm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
