\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesia Rupiah Falls Below 12,000 on U.S. Data -- Market Talk\b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Dezember 2013\par 02:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 0135 GMT [Dow Jones] The rupiah falls below IDR12,000 to the U.S. dollar for the first time since March 2009, after stronger-than-expected U.S. economic data released overnight. The break of this major psychological trading barrier is likely to lead to capitulation of short-USD positions, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smoothen excessive volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . On Tuesday, the senior deputy governor of Bank Indonesia revealed a tolerance for a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but said that the ideal value for the rupiah should be between IDR11,000-IDR11,500 in order to boost exports and at the same time curb imports. The Indonesia \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been urging local exporters to sell their U.S. dollar earnings at these elevated levels - likely an attempt to help buffer the rupiah from further weakness. The notoriously low level of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves held by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  restricts its ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling U.S. dollars directly in the spot market.\par \par \uc2  Often, verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is employed to shore up the rupiah. USD/IDR is now 11,990, easing from its almost five-year high of 12,025. (ewen.chew@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; MarketTalk@dowjones.com \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 04, 2013 20:35 ET (01:35 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020131205e9c50002c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
