\par\par \b \uc2 *\uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  Gov: Rupiah Level Reflects Economic Fundamentals\b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 2013\par 07:09\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 29 Nov 2013 01:10 EDT *\uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  Gov: To Prioritize 'Stability Over Growth'\par \par \uc2 29 Nov 2013 01:11 EDT *\uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gov: To \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if Necessary\par \par \uc2 29 Nov 2013 01:39 EDT  \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor: Rupiah Level Reflects Economic Fundamentals\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Farida Husna \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 JAKARTA--The rupiah's current level against the U.S. dollar reflects Indonesia's economic fundamentals, Bank Indonesia Governor Agus Martowardojo said Friday, reiterating that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will continue to pursue policies to stabilize the economy rather than boosting growth.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Our problem is the current account deficit, which needs to be fixed first," Mr. Martowardojo told reporters.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The rupiah is hovering near a 4.5-year low of IDR12,000 against the dollar, falling nearly 20% so far this year on jitters that Indonesia's huge current account deficit will keep the country vulnerable to capital outflows if the U.S. Federal Reserve starts tapering its bond-buying program.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Martowardojo said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will closely monitor the rupiah's movements and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if necessary.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Two dealers said they suspect that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had earlier Friday sold around $25 million around IDR11,990 to prevent the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from falling too fast.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Despite this, dealers don't think \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  is trying to resist the rupiah's weakness but is merely smoothening its decline to avoid panic among businesses and the public.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Farida Husna at farida.husna@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 29, 2013 01:39 ET (06:39 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020131129e9bt0009i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
